    <p>Standard fuels (E10 and B7_STANDARD) have the broadest coverage, reported by the majority of stations. Premium and specialty fuels such as B7_PREMIUM and B10 are reported by far fewer stations, reflecting both lower market demand and potentially less rigorous compliance with reporting requirements for these grades.</p>

